   "text": "V1 · Compact list. One line per subscription, the tag first; the window shows ten at once.\nBrings: the most rows, the simplest to code. Costs: the long deadlines are shortened.\nThe ending and the ended ones below, after a scroll (▸ Terminés folded).",
   "originalText": "V1 · Compact list. One line per subscription, the tag first; the window shows ten at once.\nBrings: the most rows, the simplest to code. Costs: the long deadlines are shortened.\nThe ending and the ended ones below, after a scroll (▸ Terminés folded).",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
