   "text": "At the default size (720 × 560), in French (the longest language), with sample data: today is Thursday 19 November 2026.\nGrayscale: « aujourd'hui » (urgent) and « bientôt » (soon) are tags; the colors come with the mock-up. Pick one, or take blocks from several.",
